     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nwho wants to go to So-Cal ?</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4755...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4755...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Mark Maunder &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmau...@iattc.org</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, July 12, 2023 20:00<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Vacancy announcement: Senior Quantitative Scientist at the IATTC</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\" lang=\"EN-US\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nPlease distribute the following announcement to as many people as you can.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nThe Inter-American Tropical Tuna Commission (IATTC) invites applications for the position of Senior Quantitative Scientist in La Jolla, California, U.S.A. Work covers range of topics, which often involve quantitative methods development, including population\r\n trend estimation, population assessments, spatio-temporal studies of fishing vessel behavior, development of sophisticated data screening algorithms for fisheries data review, and sampling designs for data collection by human observers and electronic monitoring.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nFor more details see <a href=\"https://www.iattc.org/getattachment/5e7aff34-71bd-4906-a47f-db22d7d3a28b/IATTC_Senior-Quantitative-Scientist-2023.pdf?lang=en-US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.iattc.org/getattachment/5e7aff34-71bd-4906-a47f-db22d7d3a28b/IATTC_Senior-Quantitative-Scientist-2023.pdf?lang%3Den-US&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448860265000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0y8FMHASq3CKofoZV9-2dc\">\r\nhttps://www.iattc.org/getattachment/5e7aff34-71bd-4906-a47f-db22d7d3a28b/IATTC_Senior-Quantitative-Scientist-2023.pdf?lang=en-US</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nSpanish <a href=\"https://www.iattc.org/getattachment/08a0c13b-c984-461e-a2fa-4df141914167/IATTC_Cientifico-Cuantitativo-Principal-2023.pdf?lang=es-ES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.iattc.org/getattachment/08a0c13b-c984-461e-a2fa-4df141914167/IATTC_Cientifico-Cuantitativo-Principal-2023.pdf?lang%3Des-ES&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448860265000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Yja6KzCF1397e0yweEAh_\">\r\nhttps://www.iattc.org/getattachment/08a0c13b-c984-461e-a2fa-4df141914167/IATTC_Cientifico-Cuantitativo-Principal-2023.pdf?lang=es-ES</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width:202.4pt;background:white;border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:6.75pt;margin-right:6.75pt;margin-bottom:5.75pt\" width=\"270\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:45.55pt\">\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border:none;border-bottom:solid #0060b9 2.25pt;padding:0in 5.0pt 0in 5.0pt;height:45.55pt\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Constantia&quot;,serif;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in;color:rgb(40,54,85)\">Mark Maunder</span></i><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in;color:black\">Inter-American Tropical Tuna Commission</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;line-height:9.6pt\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Senior Scientist</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;line-height:9.6pt\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Head, Stock Assessment Program</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:50.75pt\